ow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assumed the intent of not putting a segregated area for specialties was to both emphasize that they don't have ratings like prior editions did, and to get people writing the specialty next to the skill as is standard practice in other White Wolf/Onyx Path games.</div> </div> </div> </div>It does make it awkward in those cases where you have more than one specialty in an Ability. Someone with Lore for example will quickly run into problems, as they can easily rack up half a dozen or more Specialties.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/158192-what-s-your-custom-legacy?p=1109906#post1109906\" target=\"_blank\">My custom legacy</a> (2e)- The Disciples of Rathma - Life/Death focused Moros/Thyrsus Legacy, comments appreciated","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/166-joker","name":"Joker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T05:08:31-08:00","id":746394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Keichiokami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=724101#post724101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you Mr Gone! You have been prvoding quaility sheets for a long time and I thank you profusly for your many years of creating awesome character sheets for all of us.<br /> Oh um so the boxes print a R with circles around them? o.O</div> </div> </div> </div>Are you printing the sheets from within your web browser, or from an actual PDF reader? On occasion, I have noticed Chrome's in-browser PDF reader messing up certain characters, and this might be a similar issue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9008-staffan","name":"Staffan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T08:33:19-08:00","id":746679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Joker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=746319#post746319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the sheets, they are great!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Joker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=746319#post746319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It only really matters during charcreation, so it isn't important, but some way to differentiate between Caste, Favoured and Supernal Abilities would be great.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm...something to think on I guess.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Joker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=746319#post746319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does make it awkward in those cases where you have more than one specialty in an Ability. Someone with Lore for example will quickly run into problems, as they can easily rack up half a dozen or more Specialties.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats a lot of specialties...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Staffan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=746394#post746394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you printing the sheets from within your web browser, or from an actual PDF reader? On occasion, I have noticed Chrome's in-browser PDF reader messing up certain characters, and this might be a similar issue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of what I was wondering too...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character