tp://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Exalted/Exalted3rdED_2-Pagev3_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">custom Character Sheet</a> he made for my specs)</div> </div> </div> </div>This is looking nice. Now if I can only convince a player to take craft... Maybe I should find a game where I can be a crafter. Damn you Michael Scott Rohan for making me want to see an in-game crafter in action.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/977-major","name":"Major","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar977_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-21T04:30:59-07:00","id":918554,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=918338#post918338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Didn't think it needed a new thread, so I've posted it here. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> and I have been brainstorming a Craft sheet for players to use.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_CraftingSheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Crafting Sheet</a><br /> <br /> Once it's considered finished, he'll make it interactive like his other character sheets. <i><b>It should be noted that this is designed to work with the base Craft system out of the core, not any of the custom Craft systems</b>. </i>That said, <b>if anyone has input on how to make this better with those guidelines in place, please let us know</b> so we can put the final polish on this. Mr Gone has been generous with his time and skills in making these for folks, and I for one am super appreciative. (Check out the <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Exalted/Exalted3rdED_2-Pagev3_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">custom Character Sheet</a> he made for my specs)</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for posting this up for people to check out. If everyone likes it(or has suggestion), once it's finalized, I'll make it interactive.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Major</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=918463#post918463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is looking nice. Now if I can only convince a player to take craft... Maybe I should find a game where I can be a crafter. Damn you Michael Scott Rohan for making me want to see an in-game crafter in action.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy bo