rum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar368_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"368\" data-vbnamecard=\"368\">The Unsung Hero</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4959-drdog\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4959_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4959\" data-vbnamecard=\"4959\">DrDog</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8781-happy-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar8781_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8781\" data-vbnamecard=\"8781\">Happy Hermit</a> I updated the sheet. Take a look, see what you think:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_CraftingSheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_CraftingSheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> 404 Not Found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_CraftingSheet.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_CraftingSheet.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I wasn't sure on the slot tracks if they needed the boxes or not, so I'll remove em if not...<br /> <br /> Anyway, let me know what you think!</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally I think it looks amazing! Anyone who's look at the math on Craft know if that is enough slots for 90% of games?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T12:23:25-07:00","id":921083,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=921035#post921035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Personally I think it looks amazing!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Glad you're liking it so far!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=921035#post921035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone who's look at the math on Craft know if that is enough slots for 90% of games?</div> </div> </div> </div>If it's not enough, I can always do a separate page full of just the crafting slots. Or add a 2nd page to this one...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T12:25:19-07:00","id":921086,"title":"","content":"Oh wow, a craft sheet is something I did not realize I need until now, even though I'm playing a crafter. Till now I was satisfied with a word document. But the sheet looks just awesome. An interactive version will be really useful. So thank you Mr Gone! <br /> <br /> A few thoughts: <br /> I honestly don't know if a willpower-esque presentation is the most optimal. With every repurchase bought a dedicated crafter can get up to 13 Major and 5 Superior regular Project Slots, I think. This is excluding temporary slots that can always be created anew without an upper limit. And if I would take charm texts as system expectation then an high xp crafter will, at some point in his crafting career, have <i>at least</i> 10 legendary project slots in use (as per Wonder-Forging Genius). <br /> In my Essence 2 game the highest number of Major Project Slots I had in use at the same time was 5 (3 regular and 2 temporary slots). <br /> <br /> So maybe two lines for &quot;base&quot; and temporary project slots and two where you can would be more convenient in the long run. Can't say for sure though since I can't see my crafter getting to the &quot;at least 10 legendaries at once&quot; point at all. <br /> <br /> &quot;Level&quot; is for the Artifact Rating, right? Maybe just replace Level with Rating just to use the same term as the system, but that is just a very minor complaint.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My (mostly) German Exalted blog: <a href=\"http://ryokiseck.de/\" target=\"_blank\">Praise the Spiral!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11185-ryoki","name":"Ryoki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T14:25:15-07:00","id":921157,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryoki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=921086#post921086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh wow, a craft sheet is something I did not realize I need until now, even though I'm playing a crafter. Till now I was satisfied with a word document. But the sheet looks just awesome. An interactive version will be really useful. So thank you Mr Gone!</div> </div> </div> </div>You're very welcome! Glad you like it. It was <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar368_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"368\" data-vbnamecard=\"368\">The Unsung Hero</a>'s idea, so I can't take all the credit. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryoki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=921086#post921086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few thoughts:<br /> I honestly don't know if a willpower-esque presentation is the most optimal. With every repurchase bought a dedicated crafter can get up to 13 Major and 5 Superior regular Project Slots, I think. This is excluding temporary slots that can always be created anew without an upper limit. And if I would take charm texts as system expectation then an high xp crafter will, at some point in his crafting career, have <i>at least</i> 10 legendary project slots in use (as per Wonder-Forging Genius).<br /> In my Essence 2 game the highest number of Major Project Slots I had in use at the same time was 5 (3 regular and 2 temporary slots).<br /> <br /> So maybe two lines for &quot;base&quot; and temporary project slots and two where you can would be more convenient in the long run. Can't say for sure though since I can't see my crafter getting to the &quot;at least 10 legendaries at once&quot; point at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, you don't think we need the willpower-esque track at all? Or we should replace it with a line or two where you just write it down?<br /> <br /> Sorry, I don't know much about the system, so bear with me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryoki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=921086#post921086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Level&quot; is for the Artifact Rating, right? Maybe just replace Level with Rating just to use the same term as the system, but that is just a very minor complaint.</div> </div> </div> </div>That could fairly easily be done...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T18:48:18-07:00","id":921282,"title":"","content":"Would you <i>like</i> to play, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T19:35:27-07:00","id":921304,"title":"","content":"That looks good from my end. I agree with Ryoki that willpower track isn't the best, but I can't think of a better way to do it. How it works is that you use two lower ranked slots to create one temporary high ranked slot for a project. Afterh project is complete, you loose your higher ranked slot, and your low ranked slots refresh. But I can't see how to put that neatly on a reusable paper sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4959-drdog","name":"DrDog","ava