need, and it's all pretty compact. 10/10, would craft with again.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hee hee..coolness! Glad to hear you like it! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=923827#post923827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bravo sir. Looks rad.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! Well, I'll make it interactive then and you'll be set!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=923827#post923827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll put together some notes for the Sorcery thing sometime soon if you're still up for that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, that'll work! Thanks!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-30T17:12:02-07:00","id":924184,"title":"","content":"Here is the Interactive version of the Crafting Sheet: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Exalted/Exalted3rdED_CraftingSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T07:15:56-07:00","id":929710,"title":"","content":"Much obliged, Mr Gone <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Long time lurker","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8781-happy-hermit","name":"Happy Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8781_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T08:13:46-07:00","id":929745,"title":"","content":"Alrighty, now for a Sorcery page. Off the bat, I'm thinking it needs at least 2, maybe 3 sections. We'll see if people can vote on the 3rd. It needs to have a small section at the start for Sorcerous Initiations, and then a section for Spells.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Section 1: Initiations</b></u><br /> The Initiations section could be done simply with lines. It should have:<br /> <i>Sorcerous Initiation</i>: (and a line long enough for a title)<br /> <i>Shaping Ritual</i>: (More space for this one. Imagine someone may write 2 long sentences per Ritual)<br /> <i>Merits</i>: (Potentially we could include merits that are provided by an Initiation. Shouldn't need more than a title and dots, just like the main character page. I'm not convinced this needs to be on here; I could go either way)<br /> <br /> This could be arranged in a few ways. <br /> <b>Setup A:</b> Per 1 Initiation, 1-2 spaces for Rituals, and 3 spaces for Merits. Have 3 Initiation categories per Sheet.<br /> <b>Setup B:</b> 3 Spaces for Initiations grouped together, then maybe 3-4 spaces for Rituals, and then I guess 6 spaces for Merits. Each category grouped together.<br /> <br /> Setup B implies that it's not important to associate your Rituals and Merits with your Initiations, but maybe that's important to some people? Obviously some people could go out of their way to learn a lot of extra Initiations or Rituals, but I'm not against making people print off an extra page to accommodate that. If people are bothered by stuff being separated out, it could go with Setup A.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Section 2: Spells</u></b><br /> Spells could be modeled after your Craft Projects. It would probably benefit from the same number of lines, but most of it is for the description. It should have:<br /> <i>Spell</i>: (for the spell name. Doesn't need a long line)<br /> <i>Circle</i>: (Short space, just enough for a single word: Terrestrial, Celestial, or Solar)<br /> <i>Cost</i>: (Should be long enough to potentially include &quot;Ritual, 2wp&quot; which I think is the longest character-string that could occur<br /> <i>Keywords:</i> A longer line for this. Could have a few words in it<br /> <i>Duration</i>: Same length as Keywords<br /> <i>Description: </i>Fill the rest of the space with lines for this.<br /> <br /> This will be easier to set up and should only require changing names in the Craft Projects sheet to match. In fact... You can pretty much just...<br /> Replace <b>Project</b> with <b>Spell</b><br /> Replace<b> XP Cost</b> with <b>Circle</b><br /> Replace <b>Level</b> with <b>Cost</b><br /> Keep <b>Duration</b><br /> Replace <b>Target </b>with <b>Keywords</b><br /> Replace <b>Progress </b>with <b>Description</b><br /> Convert the <b>Reward</b> and <b>Completed </b>spaces with<b> lines for text</b> from Description<br /> <br /> That should do it.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Section 3: Workings (Optional)</u></b><br /> I'm not sold that this section needs to exist at all. If it did, it would be again modeled after the Craft Projects section. You'd need:<br /> <i>Working:</i> (Space for the working name)<br /> <i>XP Cost</i>: (not rocket science)<br /> <i>Circle</i>: Space for a word (terrestrial, celestial, solar)<br /> <i>Ambition</i>: Same space as XP Cost<br /> <i>Finesse</i>: Same space as XP Cost<br /> <i>Means</i>: One line across<br /> <i>Goal Number</i>: Same space as XP Cost<br /> <i>Terminus</i>: Same space as XP Cost<br /> <i>Description</i>: As many lines of space are remaining after the above<br /> <br /> This section might be useful for tracking, it might not. I'm open to suggestions. If we did though, it would probably take enough space that we'd need 2 sheets. 1 sheet for Initiations and Workings, and another for Spells. I'll let people vote and talk it over.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-11T12:49:07-07:00","id":929908,"title":"","content":"Great work as always MrGone. <br /> <br /> The Unsung Hero: I wote for a 2 sheet version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6061-morhimgol","name":"morhimgol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6061_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Pos