-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_SorcerySheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_SorcerySheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> 404 Not Found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_SorcerySheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/Exalted3rdED_SorcerySheet_Interactive.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I added the extra line for the Shaping Rituals, and then added the spells section. I didn't add the workings sections, as I wasn't sure if we still needed it. If so...then I can re-work things...<br /> <br /> Anyway, hope you like it so far...</div> </div> </div> </div>Other than the word Circle being mispelled in every Spell slot, I think this looks spectacular! I keep trying to think of ways to add more space to the description, but that's probably the best we'll get for a while. I dig it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T18:47:01-07:00","id":947387,"title":"","content":"I agree, it looks great!<br /> <br /> As far as giving more space to descriptions: hypothetically, you could cut some of the spell slots to give each remaining spell description more lines to work with, and then have a second page (separate doc maybe) dedicated solely to additional spells, lacking the Initiations section. This way players can have the Initiations+Spells as their first page, and just Spells as consecutive pages afterward in case they really dig into Sorcery (since I imagine people are more likely to get &gt;10 spells than &gt;3 initiations).<br /> <br /> Unless this has already been brainstormed and turned down?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Artifact Journeyman?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11797-seeker","name":"Seeker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T19:39:22-07:00","id":947429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seeker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=947387#post947387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree, it looks great!<br /> <br /> As far as giving more space to descriptions: hypothetically, you could cut some of the spell slots to give each remaining spell description more lines to work with, and then have a second page (separate doc maybe) dedicated solely to additional spells, lacking the Initiations section. This way players can have the Initiations+Spells as their first page, and just Spells as consecutive pages afterward in case they really dig into Sorcery (since I imagine people are more likely to get &gt;10 spells than &gt;3 initiations).<br /> <br /> Unless this has already been brainstormed and turned down?</div> </div> </div> </div>Much has been suggested. Very little has been voted on. If there's interest, Mr Gone is usually willing to do it, thus far. The man is a miracle-worker.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T22:14:12-07:00","id":947508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=947429#post947429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Much has been suggested. Very little has been voted on. If there's interest, Mr Gone is usually willing to do it, thus far. The man is a miracle-worker.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think a workings sheet would be good all by itself. 5 Rows, 2 Columns, 1 section (10 total workings boxes). Layout something like this?:<br /> Working:___________________________<br /> Circle: ________________ Ambition: ____<br /> Base Finesse: ____ Ending Finesse: ____<br /> Means: ____________________________<br /> __________________________________<br /> Terminus:_____ Goal Number: _____<br /> Description of Working: _______________<br /> __________________________________<br /> __________________________________<br /> __________________________________<br /> Complications:______________________<br /> __________________________________<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ex3 Craft <a href=\"http://madletter.net/rpg/exalted/maudova/Craft_Rewrite.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">rewrite</a>.<br /> ExEssence <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18jTwAx0Pldsg5Zt-63HW77zprWvXRTsmz4VrRKZvB8c/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Community Homebrew Compilation</a><br /> Twitter Handle: at maudovajr<br /> Discord Handle: Maudova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12102-maudova","name":"Maudova","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T09:32:11-07:00","id":947821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maudova</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=947508#post947508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think a workings sheet would be good all by itself. 5 Rows, 2 Columns, 1 section (10 total workings boxes). Layout something like this?:<br /> Working:___________________________<br /> Circle: ________________ Ambition: ____<br /> Base Finesse: ____ Ending Finesse: ____<br /> Means: ____________________________<br /> __________________________________<br /> Terminus:_____ Goal Number: _____<br /> Description of Working: _______________<br /> __________________________________<br /> __________________________________<br /> __________________________________<br /> Complications:______________________<br /> __________________________________</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah I'll go ahead and say this is a solid design. A page of this would work fine!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T15:48:15-07:00","id":948139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=947383#post947383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Other than the word Circle being mispelled in every Spell slot, I think this looks spectacular! I keep trying to think of ways to add more space to the description, but that's probably the best we'll get for a while. I dig it!</div> </div> </div> </div>NOOOOOOOOOOOOO....lol. I hate when I do that. :P<br /> <br /> I'll get that taken care of...<br /> <br /> I think I could sneak in another line, maybe two to description. I'll give it a try, since I have to fix the typo anyway. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seeker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=947387#post947387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree, it looks great!<br /> <br /> As far as giving more space to descriptions: hypothetically, you could cut some of the spell slots to give each remaining spell description more lines to work with, and then have a second page (separate doc maybe) dedicated solely to additional spells, lacking the Initiations section. This way players can have the Initiations+Spells as their first page, and just Spells as consecutive pages afterward in case they really dig into Sorcery (since I imagine people are more likely to get &gt;10 spells than &gt;3 initiations).<br /> <br /> Unless this has already been brainstormed and turned down?</div> </div> </div> </div>I might be able to add a 2nd page for more spells...shouldn't be an issue.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=947429#post947429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Much has been suggested. Very little has been voted on. If there's interest, Mr Gone is usually willing to do it, thus far. The man is a miracle-worker.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, I do try...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <di