 href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T15:17:18-07:00","id":1213197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1213002#post1213002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, I\u2019ll try the normal 3rd Ed. sheet and see. I\u2019ve been trying to use the one with excellencies and range tables. I also noticed that the weapon section on there has columns for wit and dec (withering and decisive, I imagine), but those aren\u2019t useful distinctions. The number of columns is right, but it would be better if the column headers matched the way they are in the core book.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was my fault. I pushed for a version where you totaled up your Withering Attack pool, Withering Damage pool, and Decisive Attack pool instead of just the components as shown in the core book so I don't have to do math every single time I want to roll. I've pre-done the math. So that change was my fault. Was hard to find a 3 letter shorthand for those pools...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T11:23:28-07:00","id":1213491,"title":"","content":"Any chance of a 3rd ED dragonblood sheet? i know Onyx have not made one yet (i assume/hope they do in the finished DB book) I dont like the way the abilities are shown in the solar sheet <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2610-lycaniz","name":"lycaniz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2610_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T11:35:03-07:00","id":1213493,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lycaniz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1213491#post1213491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any chance of a 3rd ED dragonblood sheet? i know Onyx have not made one yet (i assume/hope they do in the finished DB book) I dont like the way the abilities are shown in the solar sheet <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1208426-db-character-sheet-3rd-ed?p=1208581#post1208581\">For your reference</a>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T16:50:56-07:00","id":1213579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1213002#post1213002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, I\u2019ll try the normal 3rd Ed. sheet and see. I\u2019ve been trying to use the one with excellencies and range tables.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure all the type in boxes for all those sheets should auto-size. But it's possible that it hits a limit and will only go down so far before it starts scrolling outside the range of the text box...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PneumaPilot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1213002#post1213002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also noticed that the weapon section on there has columns for wit and dec (withering and decisive, I imagine), but those aren\u2019t useful distinctions. The number of columns is right, but it would be better if the column headers matched the way they are in the core book.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1213197#post1213197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That was my fault. I pushed for a version where you totaled up your Withering Attack pool, Withering Damage pool, and Decisive Attack pool instead of just the components as shown in the core book so I don't have to do math every single time I want to roll. I've pre-done the math. So that change was my fault. Was hard to find a 3 letter shorthand for those pools...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup, I believe so. That's why there are a few different versions of the sheet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lycaniz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1213491#post1213491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any chance of a 3rd ED dragonblood sheet? i know Onyx have not made one yet (i assume/hope they do in the finished DB book) I dont like the way the abilities are shown in the solar sheet <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>It's on my to-do list. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Though, this is the first I've heard about the skills, I think... Should they be a different order? Or different skills? If it's just the way I listed em...that just seemed like the best way to do it considering all the stuff that needed to go on page 1, so I'm not sure of a way I could re-list them...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T07:01:32-07:00","id":1216096,"title":"","content":"Hey. the 'problem' with the skills like such is that with various aspects and castes as have 'groupings' of skills, it is much easier to have them grouped together like the 2nd edition sheets, Dawn skills together on the solar sheet, Fire aspects on the dragonblood sheets and so on. maybe it is just thematical on my part but atleast i think it is a far more satisfying solution than alphabetical <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2610-lycaniz","name":"lycaniz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2610_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T07:07:31-07:00","id":1216097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lycaniz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1216096#post1216096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey. the 'problem' with the skills like such is that with various aspects and castes as have 'groupings' of skills, it is much easier to have them grouped together like the 2nd edition sheets, Dawn skills together on the solar sheet, Fire aspects on the dragonblood sheets and so on. maybe it is just thematical on my part but atleast i think it is a far more satisfying solution than alphabetical <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That only really works with Dragon-Blooded now; they split the Abilities up nice and consistently. Since Solars have overlap in their ranges of Caste Abilities now (i.e. War is available to Dawn <i>and</i> Zenith), alphabetizing them for Solars is more or less necessary. Also... probably for Lunars since they don't do Caste Abilities in the first place.<br /> A DB-specific sheet would be best off grouping them by Aspect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T16:33:20-07:00","id":1216373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lycaniz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1216096#post1216096\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey. the 'problem' with the skills like such is that with various aspects and castes as have 'groupings' of skills, it is much easier to have them grouped together like the 2nd edition sheets, Dawn skills together on the solar sheet, Fire aspects on the dragonblood sheets and so on. maybe it is just thematical on my part but atleast i think it is a far more satisfying solution than alphabetical <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beans</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1216097#post1216097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That only really works with Dragon-Blooded now; they split the Abilities up nice and consistently. Since Solars have overlap in their ranges of Caste Abilities now (i.e. War is available to Dawn <i>and</i> Zenith), alphabetizing them for Solars is more or less necessary. Also... probably for Lunars since they don't do Caste Abilities in the first place.<br /> A DB-specific sheet would be best off grouping them by Aspect.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hmmm...well, space would still be a factor, but I suppose I could re-list them in a different order in the same column. You'd just have to let me know how they'd need to grouped...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T18:44:59-07:00","id":1216414,"title":"","content":"If there's an ask for it, definitely go for it Mr Gone. But I'd like to voice my question to the masses that, what is the real purpose of grouping them by Aspect anymore? What is gained? I sympathize with the nostalgia aesthetic, but mechanically, is it actually useful to have the abilities in a different order than alphabetically anymore? Having every Exalt character sheet in alphabetical order means I always know where to find my Melee ability. Just my 2 cents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-09T04:15:05-07:00","id":1216947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1216414#post1216414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there's an ask for it, definitely go for it Mr Gone. But I'd like to voice my question to the masses that, what is the real purpose of grouping them by Aspect anymore? What is gained? I sympathize with the nostalgia aesthetic, but mechanically, is it actually useful to have the abilities in a different order than alphabetically anymore? Having every Exalt character sheet in alphabetical order means I always know where to find my Melee ability. Just my 2 cents.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for weighing in.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-01T22:14:45-08:00","id":1293242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=950180#post950180\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post<