arget=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-17T06:23:37-07:00","id":1537557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1537255#post1537255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hey!! I could add the forms for you, but what you're wanting to do with the health levels is a bit trickier. Not impossible, but not something I've been able to do myself, since it takes a bit of programming to make work. Also, I believe making something like that would only work in Adobe Acrobat, it wouldn't function properly in another pdf reader. Best I can do in a situation like is a text field to just type in the needed symbol.<br /> <br /> But, I know a guy who has done pretty amazing stuff with form in Acrobat with the programming, so I'll add a link to his Twitter account if you'd like to reach out to him. I believe this Patreon has some free tutorials on some of his stuff, and his pinned tweet is a link to look at some of this character sheets (they're pretty awesome).<br /> <br /> Here's the link: <a href=\"https://x.com/_Nerdbert_\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/_Nerdbert_</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Ok. That stuff about the Health Levels was just an idea. It's not that important. What you suggested is fine as long as we don't have the issue I had with the original sheet where any mark made was cut off at the top. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27463,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27463-lord-tigon","user":"Lord Tigon","date":". 06-17-2024, 09:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27463-lord-tigon","name":"Lord Tigon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27463_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-17T13:06:49-07:00","id":1537579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lord Tigon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723869-exalted-3rd-ed-character-sheets?p=1537557#post1537557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok. That stuff about the Health Levels was just an idea. It's not that important. What you suggested is fine as long as we don't have the issue I had with the original sheet where any mark made was cut off at the top. Thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey again! So, I actually made that official sheet you used as your base... so, I'll just modify mine with the changes you made. Might be the easiest way to do it.<br /> <br /> If you don't mind, send me an email to: <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9af7e8fdf5f4fff0fffef3f1f4f3fdf2eedafdf7fbf3f6b4f9f5f7\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"0f627d6860616a656a6b6664616668677b4f68626e6663216c6062\">[email&#16